{"seq":2,"slug":"draw-redeem-compose","title":"抽取/兑换/集卡合成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/mystery-box-probability-commerce/probability-inventory/draw-redeem-compose","wordCount":1962,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"抽取-兑换-集卡合成\">抽取/兑换/集卡合成</h1><p>消费者拿到一件不喜欢的盲盒商品时有三个出口：退、换、留。对概率商品而言，最有效的出口既不是退货也不是换货，而是让它进入一个<strong>内部消化通道</strong>——用重复款兑换积分、用积分兑换指定款、用若干普通款合成一件稀有款。这条通道把「抽到重复款」的挫败感转成了继续消费的动力，同时把运营方积压的普通款库存盘活。代价是概率模型不再只由抽取决定，还由兑换与合成共同决定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-三条商品获取通道\">核心概念：三条商品获取通道</h2><p>一个成熟的概率商品系统同时存在三条获取路径：<strong>抽取</strong>（随机，消耗抽取额度）、<strong>兑换</strong>（确定，消耗积分或兑换券）、<strong>合成</strong>（确定，消耗若干低层商品）。三者的输出都进入同一个库存池，任何一条通道的容量变化都会影响其他两条的实际出货分布。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[抽取] --&gt;|随机出货| S[用户商品池]&#10;  B[兑换] --&gt;|确定出货| S&#10;  C[合成] --&gt;|消耗低层产出高层| S&#10;  S --&gt; D{用户决策}&#10;  D --&gt;|保留| E[收藏]&#10;  D --&gt;|重复款| F[兑换为积分]&#10;  F --&gt; B&#10;  D --&gt;|多件普通款| C&#10;  F --&gt; G[积分台账]\">graph TD\n  A[抽取] --&gt;|随机出货| S[用户商品池]\n  B[兑换] --&gt;|确定出货| S\n  C[合成] --&gt;|消耗低层产出高层| S\n  S --&gt; D{用户决策}\n  D --&gt;|保留| E[收藏]\n  D --&gt;|重复款| F[兑换为积分]\n  F --&gt; B\n  D --&gt;|多件普通款| C\n  F --&gt; G[积分台账]</pre><p>图上有两条回边：重复款换积分、多件普通款换合成。这两条回边把本来会流向退货的商品重新导回系统内部，是概率商品区别于普通零售的关键结构。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>通道</th>\n<th>随机性</th>\n<th>消耗物</th>\n<th>对概率表的影响</th>\n<th>主要风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>抽取</td>\n<td>随机</td>\n<td>抽取额度/现金</td>\n<td>直接决定出货分布</td>\n<td>保底与库存约束</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>兑换</td>\n<td>确定</td>\n<td>积分/兑换券</td>\n<td>绕过概率，需独立库存</td>\n<td>积分通胀、目标款被抽干</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合成</td>\n<td>确定</td>\n<td>若干低层商品</td>\n<td>消耗低层、产出高层</td>\n<td>合成率套利</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"兑换通道的设计\">兑换通道的设计</h2><p>兑换的本质是给概率开一个确定性的旁路。它让消费者能把运气问题转成耐心问题，也让运营方能把「总差一件」的用户留在体系内。</p>\n<h3 id=\"积分定价与通胀控制\">积分定价与通胀控制</h3><p>积分的价值必须锚定商品成本，否则会出现两种极端：积分定价过低，用户用极低成本兑换高价值商品，等价于把概率表变成摆设；积分定价过高，兑换通道没人用，重复款继续积压。定价的方法是<strong>按目标款成本反推积分价</strong>，并留出运营毛利。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE redeem_catalog (&#10;  series_id   TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  tier        TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  sku         TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  points_cost INT  NOT NULL CHECK (points_cost &gt; 0),&#10;  stock_units INT  NOT NULL CHECK (stock_units &gt;= 0),&#10;  per_user_limit INT NOT NULL DEFAULT 1,&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (series_id, sku)&#10;);&#10;&#10;-- 兑换扣减：积分与库存必须同时成功&#10;WITH spend AS (&#10;  UPDATE points_ledger&#10;  SET balance = balance - $1&#10;  WHERE user_id = $2 AND balance &gt;= $1&#10;  RETURNING user_id&#10;), take AS (&#10;  UPDATE redeem_catalog&#10;  SET stock_units = stock_units - 1&#10;  WHERE series_id = $3 AND sku = $4 AND stock_units &gt;= 1&#10;  RETURNING sku&#10;)&#10;SELECT (SELECT count(*) FROM spend) AS spent, (SELECT count(*) FROM take) AS taken;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> redeem_catalog</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  series_id   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  tier        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  sku         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  points_cost </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (points_cost </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  stock_units </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (stock_units </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  per_user_limit </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (series_id, sku)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 兑换扣减：积分与库存必须同时成功</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> spend </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> points_ledger</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SET</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> balance </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> balance </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> balance </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  RETURNING user_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">take</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> redeem_catalog</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SET</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stock_units </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stock_units </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> series_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sku </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stock_units </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  RETURNING sku</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> spend) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> spent, (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> take</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> taken;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这个 CTE 结构的价值在于把两个扣减放进同一语句，任一侧失败都能通过返回值判定并整体回滚。若拆成两次请求，会出现「扣了积分但没兑到货」或「兑了货但没扣积分」。在 PostgreSQL 中，数据修改型 CTE 与外层查询构成同一条语句，因此这两次 <code>UPDATE</code> 要么都发生要么都不发生（<a href=\"https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/sql-insert.html\">PostgreSQL INSERT / WITH</a>）。若兑换目录允许并发写入同一 SKU，还可以用 <code>ON CONFLICT DO UPDATE</code> 把「不存在则建、存在则加」合成一条原子语句。</p>\n<h3 id=\"兑换库存与抽取库存的隔离\">兑换库存与抽取库存的隔离</h3><p>一个必须明确的决定是：兑换用的隐藏款是否占用抽取用的隐藏款库存。<strong>必须隔离</strong>。理由有二：隔离后兑换不会突然抽干抽取侧的库存，使抽取概率表的成本模型失效；隔离后可以给兑换设定独立的上限，避免积分大户一次性兑空全系列。隔离的代价是同一件商品需要两笔库存记录，但这是必要的成本。</p>\n<h2 id=\"集卡合成与物价套利\">集卡合成与物价套利</h2><p>合成规则给出的是相对价值关系：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 件普通款 = 1 件稀有款。这条等式一旦与抽取概率表冲突，就会出现套利。</p>\n<h3 id=\"合成率与概率的一致性约束\">合成率与概率的一致性约束</h3><p>设普通款与稀有款的单件成本分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，合成率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>。若</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k \\cdot c_c &lt; c_r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6891em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>则合成在所有情况下都比抽取划算——只要合成通道不设限，理性用户会完全绕过抽取。这不是禁止的，但它意味着实际出货分布将由合成而非抽取决定，概率表变得名不副实。反之若 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>≫</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k \\cdot c_c \\gg c_r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6891em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≫</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，合成通道形同虚设。</p>\n<h3 id=\"合成链的深度限制\">合成链的深度限制</h3><p>多层合成（普通 → 稀有 → 隐藏）会让价值关系变成一条链。链越长，中间层的库存越容易被上游吸干。可行做法是限制合成只在相邻两层之间进行，并对每层的合成消耗设置日/周上限，使合成不会在短时间内抽空某一层。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def compose(user_stock, rules, stock, daily_used, daily_cap, today):&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;rules: [(consumed_tier, consume_n, produced_tier)]，按深度升序。&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;    plans = []&#10;    for consumed, n, produced in rules:&#10;        if daily_used.get(produced, 0) &gt;= daily_cap.get(produced, 0):&#10;            continue&#10;        times = min(user_stock.get(consumed, 0) // n,&#10;                    stock.get(produced, 0),&#10;                    daily_cap.get(produced, 0) - daily_used.get(produced, 0))&#10;        if times &gt; 0:&#10;            plans.append((consumed, n, produced, times))&#10;    return plans\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> compose</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(user_stock, rules, stock, daily_used, daily_cap, today):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"rules: [(consumed_tier, consume_n, produced_tier)]，按深度升序。\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    plans </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> consumed, n, produced </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rules:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> daily_used.get(produced, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> daily_cap.get(produced, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            continue</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        times </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> min</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(user_stock.get(consumed, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">//</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                    stock.get(produced, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                    daily_cap.get(produced, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> daily_used.get(produced, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> times </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            plans.append((consumed, n, produced, times))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> plans</span></span></code></pre></div><p>函数返回的是<strong>可执行计划</strong>而不是直接执行，因为合成必须在事务里带着库存与限流一起提交，先算后做比边算边做更容易保证原子性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三通道的一致性账本\">三通道的一致性账本</h2><p>三个通道各自扣减不同的资源（现金、积分、库存），但都产出同一批 SKU。要保证它们不出错，需要一本统一的商品台账，记录每一件商品的来源。</p>\n<h3 id=\"商品来源标记\">商品来源标记</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;unitId&quot;: &quot;u_01J8Z7K2&quot;,&#10;  &quot;seriesId&quot;: &quot;S2026-014&quot;,&#10;  &quot;sku&quot;: &quot;SKU-HIDDEN-03&quot;,&#10;  &quot;tier&quot;: &quot;hidden&quot;,&#10;  &quot;origin&quot;: &quot;redeem&quot;,&#10;  &quot;originRef&quot;: &quot;rd_20261015_8812&quot;,&#10;  &quot;ownerId&quot;: &quot;u_9f21&quot;,&#10;  &quot;acquiredAt&quot;: &quot;2026-10-15T11:02:33Z&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"unitId\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"u_01J8Z7K2\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"seriesId\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"S2026-014\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"sku\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SKU-HIDDEN-03\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"tier\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"hidden\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"origin\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"redeem\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"originRef\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"rd_20261015_8812\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"ownerId\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"u_9f21\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"acquiredAt\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-10-15T11:02:33Z\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>origin</code> 字段有三个合法值：<code>pull</code>、<code>redeem</code>、<code>compose</code>。它的用途不是展示，而是<strong>归因</strong>——当需要回答「这个系列的隐藏款实际通过什么渠道流出多少件」时，只有带来源标记的台账能给出答案。没有这个字段，兑换与合成对实际出货分布的影响就是一笔糊涂账，而概率明示的要求恰恰是对<strong>实际</strong>分布的披露，相关要求见 <a href=\"../probability-compliance/disclosure-odds-requirement\">概率明示与价值披露要求</a>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"跨通道的不变量\">跨通道的不变量</h3><p>三条通道共同维护几个不变量，应当写成巡检查询而不依赖代码正确性：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 不变量一：每个 SKU 的三通道出货量之和不超过其总入库量&#10;SELECT sku, SUM(qty) AS outbound&#10;FROM unit_ledger GROUP BY sku;  -- 与 warehouse_inbound 逐 SKU 对账&#10;&#10;-- 不变量二：积分台账余额等于所有增减之和&#10;SELECT user_id, SUM(delta) AS computed, MAX(balance) AS stored&#10;FROM points_ledger GROUP BY user_id&#10;HAVING SUM(delta) &lt;&gt; MAX(balance);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 不变量一：每个 SKU 的三通道出货量之和不超过其总入库量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sku, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(qty) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> outbound</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> unit_ledger </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sku;  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 与 warehouse_inbound 逐 SKU 对账</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 不变量二：积分台账余额等于所有增减之和</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user_id, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(delta) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> computed, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">MAX</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(balance) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stored</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> points_ledger </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">HAVING</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(delta) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> MAX</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(balance);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>第二条查询返回行即说明积分台账存在不一致，通常是并发扣减未用条件更新造成。积分与现金等价时，这类不一致直接是资金风险。两条查询都应作为巡检任务定期执行，因为不一致一旦积累，事后归因的成本远高于当时阻断（<a href=\"https://redis.io/docs/latest/develop/programmability/eval-intro/\">Redis 脚本原子性</a>——若积分余额放在 Redis 中作为快速路径，则应把判定与扣减写进单个 Lua 脚本，Lua 脚本执行期间服务器阻塞全部活动，效果要么全部发生要么全部不发生）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"兑换与合成的合规边界\">兑换与合成的合规边界</h2><p>兑换与合成在合规上有两处特殊敏感。第一，<strong>兑换比率本身就是一种价值承诺</strong>：如果对外说「1000 积分可兑换隐藏款」，那么当隐藏款库存耗尽时不能单方取消兑换，否则构成对已作出的承诺的违约，也可能被视为误导性陈述。第二，<strong>合成规则不能设计成变相的赌博</strong>：如果合成结果带随机性（例如合成时有概率产出更高层），它就从确定性通道变成了又一条随机通道，需要按概率商品重新评估，相关红线见 <a href=\"../probability-compliance/gambling-regulation-line\">各国盲盒/博彩合规边界</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>抽取、兑换、合成是三条并行的获取通道，任何一条的容量变化都会影响其他两条的实际出货分布。</li>\n<li>兑换库存必须与抽取库存隔离，否则积分大户可一次性抽干抽取侧库存，使概率成本模型失效。</li>\n<li>合成率须满足 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k \\cdot c_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的合理关系，否则合成会取代抽取成为实际出货的主通道。</li>\n<li>商品台账须带 <code>origin</code> 来源标记，否则无法归因三通道的实际出货量。</li>\n<li>积分余额应通过台账增减之和与存储余额对账的巡检查询持续校验。</li>\n<li>兑换比率是价值承诺，不得在库存耗尽时单方取消；合成若带随机性则须按概率商品重新评估。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"抽取/兑换/集卡合成","id":"抽取-兑换-集卡合成"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：三条商品获取通道","id":"核心概念-三条商品获取通道"},{"level":2,"text":"兑换通道的设计","id":"兑换通道的设计"},{"level":3,"text":"积分定价与通胀控制","id":"积分定价与通胀控制"},{"level":3,"text":"兑换库存与抽取库存的隔离","id":"兑换库存与抽取库存的隔离"},{"level":2,"text":"集卡合成与物价套利","id":"集卡合成与物价套利"},{"level":3,"text":"合成率与概率的一致性约束","id":"合成率与概率的一致性约束"},{"level":3,"text":"合成链的深度限制","id":"合成链的深度限制"},{"level":2,"text":"三通道的一致性账本","id":"三通道的一致性账本"},{"level":3,"text":"商品来源标记","id":"商品来源标记"},{"level":3,"text":"跨通道的不变量","id":"跨通道的不变量"},{"level":2,"text":"兑换与合成的合规边界","id":"兑换与合成的合规边界"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"稀有款库存与概率一致","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/mystery-box-probability-commerce/probability-inventory/rare-item-stock-consistency"},"next":{"title":"系列发售/复刻/轮换","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/mystery-box-probability-commerce/probability-inventory/series-reissue-rotation"}}